{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 85,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.3992309570312,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "groups of patients may only receive the regimen if the treating physician judges this to be the best",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        454.89703369140625,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "option despite these contraindications and where adequate monitoring is available.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        108.40792846679688,
        460.7878723144531,
        124.25992584228516
      ],
      "text": "Regimen composition, dosing of component medicines and frequency",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        131.4678497314453,
        527.4739379882812,
        145.9108428955078
      ],
      "text": "The BPaLM/BPaL regimen consists of bedaquiline, pretomanid and linezolid, with or without",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        144.6678009033203,
        527.4024658203125,
        159.1107940673828
      ],
      "text": "moxifloxacin throughout the regimen duration. Pretomanid is administered at 200 mg once daily for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.86793518066406,
        527.3858642578125,
        172.31092834472656
      ],
      "text": "the duration of the regimen. When moxifloxacin is part of the regimen, it is dosed at 400 mg once",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        171.0679473876953,
        527.4454345703125,
        185.5109405517578
      ],
      "text": "daily throughout the treatment course. The fluoroquinolone of choice used in the TB-PRACTECAL",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        184.26783752441406,
        527.5181274414062,
        198.71083068847656
      ],
      "text": "trial was moxifloxacin; given that no evidence on using other fluoroquinolones was available at",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        197.4678497314453,
        527.4212036132812,
        211.9108428955078
      ],
      "text": "the time of the GDG assessments, the replacement of moxifloxacin with levofloxacin or any other",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        210.6678009033203,
        527.4089965820312,
        225.1107940673828
      ],
      "text": "fluoroquinolone cannot be recommended at this stage. The frequency of dosing should be 7 days",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        223.86781311035156,
        527.4188842773438,
        238.31080627441406
      ],
      "text": "a week with treatment support or using video-supported therapy; that is, as it was administered in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        237.0678253173828,
        136.6350860595703,
        251.5108184814453
      ],
      "text": "both the trials.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        267.91168212890625,
        224.8621063232422,
        283.5716857910156
      ],
      "text": "Bedaquiline dosing schemes",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        290.77960205078125,
        527.39599609375,
        305.2226257324219
      ],
      "text": "The TB-PRACTECAL and ZeNix trials used slightly different dosing schemes for bedaquiline although",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        302.70361328125,
        527.40478515625,
        318.4226379394531
      ],
      "text": "(31) the overall drug exposure was comparable  . The dosing schedule used in the TB-PRACTECAL",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        317.17962646484375,
        527.4146728515625,
        331.6226501464844
      ],
      "text": "trial was consistent with the product label whereas the dosing schedule used in the ZeNix trial",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        330.3796081542969,
        527.3980102539062,
        344.8226318359375
      ],
      "text": "presented the advantage of daily dosing throughout the regimen and may be used as one of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        343.5796203613281,
        527.4188842773438,
        358.02264404296875
      ],
      "text": "options for administration. Either of the bedaquiline dosing schemes may be used for programmatic",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        356.77960205078125,
        145.33609008789062,
        371.2226257324219
      ],
      "text": "implementation:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        378.4835205078125,
        78.23609924316406,
        392.9265441894531
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        378.4835205078125,
        519.1788940429688,
        392.9265441894531
      ],
      "text": "daily throughout treatment: 200 mg once daily for 8 weeks followed by 100 mg once daily; and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        391.6835021972656,
        78.23609924316406,
        406.12652587890625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        391.6835021972656,
        527.1385498046875,
        406.12652587890625
      ],
      "text": "daily for loading dose and three times per week thereafter: 400 mg once daily for 2 weeks followed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.976174354553223,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        404.8835144042969,
        236.59442138671875,
        419.3265380859375
      ],
      "text": "by 200 mg three times per week.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        435.7274169921875,
        176.04971313476562,
        451.3874206542969
      ],
      "text": "Dosing of linezolid",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        458.5953063964844,
        527.3045654296875,
        473.038330078125
      ],
      "text": "The ZeNix trial used several different dosing and duration schemes of linezolid, with the aim of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        471.7953186035156,
        527.5756225585938,
        486.23834228515625
      ],
      "text": "determining the optimal administration schedule for this medicine. Linezolid is known to cause several",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.970059394836426,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        484.9953918457031,
        527.3980712890625,
        499.43841552734375
      ],
      "text": "potentially serious adverse effects; among those of most concern are peripheral neuropathy, optic",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        496.9193115234375,
        527.4061889648438,
        512.6383056640625
      ],
      "text": "(45) neuritis and myelosuppression  . The GDG review of the ZeNix trial data identified the optimal",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        511.395263671875,
        527.4334716796875,
        525.8382568359375
      ],
      "text": "dosing for linezolid to be 600 mg once a day for 26 weeks, and this arm of the ZeNix trial was used",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        524.5953369140625,
        527.4114379882812,
        539.038330078125
      ],
      "text": "for the main comparisons. Study participants in this arm of the trial received 600 mg of linezolid",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        537.7952880859375,
        527.4410400390625,
        552.23828125
      ],
      "text": "once daily for 26 weeks, with a reduction to 300 mg daily allowed in the event of linezolid specific",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        550.995361328125,
        527.2186279296875,
        565.4383544921875
      ],
      "text": "toxicities. In the TB-PRACTECAL trial, dosing of linezolid was slightly different – participants were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        564.1953125,
        527.4158325195312,
        578.6383056640625
      ],
      "text": "given 600 mg daily for 16 weeks and then 300 mg daily for the remaining 8 weeks (the duration of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.3953247070312,
        225.41726684570312,
        591.8383178710938
      ],
      "text": "BPaLM in this trial was 24 weeks).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        599.0993041992188,
        527.3992309570312,
        613.5422973632812
      ],
      "text": "The GDG panel considered that it would be preferable to use linezolid 600 mg/daily throughout the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        612.29931640625,
        470.83502197265625,
        626.7423095703125
      ],
      "text": "regimen, but the dose can be reduced to 300 mg/daily if necessary to mitigate toxicity.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        643.1431884765625,
        304.25653076171875,
        658.80322265625
      ],
      "text": "Regimen duration, changes and extensions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        666.0111083984375,
        527.4281005859375,
        680.4541015625
      ],
      "text": "The BPaLM and BPaL regimens have been studied as the standardized courses of treatment. Therefore,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.953049659729004,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        679.2111206054688,
        527.4410400390625,
        693.6541137695312
      ],
      "text": "modification of the regimen through early discontinuation or replacement of any of the component",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        692.4111328125,
        527.3958740234375,
        706.8541259765625
      ],
      "text": "medicines may result in different (and possibly worse) treatment outcomes. In the TB-PRACTECAL",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        705.611083984375,
        527.4541625976562,
        720.0540771484375
      ],
      "text": "trial, patients received 24 weeks of BPaLM. In the ZeNix trial, treatment was extended to a total of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        718.8110961914062,
        527.4058227539062,
        733.2540893554688
      ],
      "text": "9 months in patients on the BPaL regimen who remained sputum culture positive or who reverted",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        732.0111083984375,
        527.390380859375,
        746.4541015625
      ],
      "text": "to being sputum culture positive between months 4 and 6, or whose clinical condition suggested",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        745.2111206054688,
        527.2352294921875,
        759.6541137695312
      ],
      "text": "they may have progressive TB. In cases where treatment was interrupted and treatment duration was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.994647979736328,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        758.4111328125,
        527.44873046875,
        772.8541259765625
      ],
      "text": "extended to make up for missed doses, it was necessary for patients to complete 6 months of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        330.23760986328125,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0401611328125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 2 Drug-resistant TB treatment: Recommendations  71",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}